# The app no longer reads a .env file and must never contain secrets:
# anything bundled in the app can be extracted from the APK.
#
# All keys (CamPay, Hugging Face, Vonage SMS, WhatsApp) are configured on the
# Cloud Functions side — see functions/.env.example.
#
# App build options (non-secret) are passed with --dart-define, e.g.:
#   flutter build apk --dart-define=CAMPAY_ENV=production
